      "uid": "math-source-45",
      "title": "齐次线性方程组",
      "content": "线性无关\t只有零解\t\tr(A)=n\n线性相关\t有非零解\t\tr(A)<n",
      "subject": "linear-algebra",
      "chapter": "linear-algebra-4"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "stableId": "MATH-046",
      "uid": "math-source-46",
      "title": "非齐次线性方程组",
      "content": "无穷多解\tr(A)=r(A,b)<n\n唯一解\t\tr(A)=r(A,b)=n\n无解\t\tr(A)+1=r(A,b)",
      "subject": "linear-algebra",
      "chapter": "linear-algebra-4"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "stableId": "MATH-047",
      "uid": "math-source-47",
